  "closure": "Exact 25 backend + 23 frontend + 13 location-guidance + 2 existing test-walker inputs. Equals every changed candidate input since the installed 418880a2 baseline. All seven actual commands passed on the same stable 1328 inputs. Original seven failed expectations retained in run-01; test bodies unchanged by walker repairs.",
  "boundaries": [
    "Source, unit, DTO-wire and controlled-browser evidence do not establish installed application, real-Agent or complete H15 acceptance.",
    "Removal only covers clean, owned, archived linked worktrees after actual commit-recovery verification and a separate exact confirmation; branches/history retained.",
    "Recovery creates a new independent repository; explicit Use is separate. Historical cwd remains unchanged.",
    "Recovery receipt existence does not prove the original location absent and must not suppress its normal retry.",
    "Path-based Git and file operations do not provide operating-system exclusion from external edits. Arbitrary ACL/xattrs and remote-push status are outside this verified recovery scope.",
    "Six existing ignored Rust cases are not passed. Windows, all 29 Agent standards and the full capability plan remain open."
  ]
